{"server":"cn","storyId":"act34side_level_act34side_07_end","groupId":"act34side","stageId":"act34side_07","title":"从历史中来","storyCode":"BP-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"6dd74808ef8f62b5b4a441df85cdc7b5b3ef74f756d94b2f95edeaf7f1ad8fb4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"神秘的海嗣降临城市。凯尔希等人得知了深海教会的由来，以及有关海嗣的更多真相。歌蕾蒂娅赶回城市，却没能留下乌尔比安。乌尔比安将已经巢穴化的信标塔与城市分离，与其共同沉入海底。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，你已在大地上奔行良久，天空上的剧变，你不会注意不到。"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣微微仰起头颅。尽管已经没有眼睛，但它似乎仍在习惯性地仰望。\n穹顶之上，无垠的海水之上，仿佛有什么遥远的物事吸引了它的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，那个被撕开的空洞，还有多久愈合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔的判断没有错，海嗣摒弃对海洋的依恋，向陆地大举进发，确实是出于一个明确的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们留意到了阻隔层的变化，你们为此而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大群在海岸上的眼睛，向我传递它的所见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天空漾起涟漪，万古不变的膜被撕破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“生存”的本能驱使着你们捕捉环境里的每一丝变化......以及变化所预示的危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危险？是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然。凯尔希，你很敏锐，你的程序运行得相当流畅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的交流，会十分有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高悬泰拉之上的灾厄，凝视着我们的眼睛，是否会窥见天空的异常？还是说，它已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，你了解泰拉，也了解它所面临的危机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能做到，你应当做。帮助大群理解，帮助大群进化。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希，我应该没有听错吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"罗德岛来到这里的目标可是解决你们。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，我希望眼下的话题只是这只海嗣的一厢情愿，而不是你们之间的某种共识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执政官阁下，让它说完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后的时机，正在消逝。泰拉的海洋，太过狭隘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更多知识，更多养分，更多空间。大群需要加速，大群需要帮助。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"难道你们不仅想要爬上陆地？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"难道你们还想要飞上太空？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长出翅膀，不难，但远远不够。突破天空，需要族群进行本质性的蜕变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，你掌握足够的知识，你帮助大群理解一切，我们摆脱灾厄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕来历特殊，海嗣也终归只是被本能驱动的非智慧生物。而深海教会，也不过是在海嗣身上寄予了太多妄想的痴愚之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你所知晓的，远超这二者所能触及的极限。怎么会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一样，凯尔希。族群与你，拥有同样使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该换一个问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣为什么会演变成如今的模样？你与深蓝之树的失控究竟存在怎样的联系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你而言很重要吗，这个答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我身上发生的一切，我可以告诉你。如果这能帮助你理解我的来意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一场迟来两百余年的质询。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛利图斯，那次失败的科考任务，背后的真相是什么？你究竟为什么变成了现在这副模样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失败？不。那是最大的成功。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们首次进入了地幔遗迹群的最下层。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前人类挖空整片岩层，建造了迷宫般的综合体。改造的痕迹直达下地幔层，我们此前数千年的发掘，依然只停留在它的外围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地幔遗迹群，阿戈尔文明的原点，我们以为它的深处埋藏着更多遗产、更多秘密、更多答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们所期待的，都不存在。埋藏在深处的，只有一个渺小的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的队员们都在路途中走失，只有我，只有我来到了道路的尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里，我看见......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i07_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"巨物。巨物在深蓝的树影中沉眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没法看清祂的全貌，仅仅一小截触肢，就已经占据我视野的全部——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祂的触肢贴在透明的密封舱壁上。祂始终保持那个姿势，或许在等待一次触碰，又或许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反应过来的时候，我已经站在祂的面前，伸出了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"舱壁是冷的，但我能感受到祂的体温。然后，海潮般的景象从四面八方向我涌来，将我淹没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一只巨兽向你分享了它的视界。你看到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坠落的城市、低垂的天幕、燃烧的大地、熄灭的星门、破碎的星环、断裂的路网......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是......先史文明的覆灭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是。阿戈尔始终没能确证先史文明覆灭的原因，但那一刻，毁灭的景象就在我的眼前复现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但那不是终点。那之后仍有景象源源不断地涌出——远超出我认知边界的景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"永远离散的粒子与再无波澜的沙海......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"冰冷无光的荒原与永无尽头的黑暗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"燃烧崩毁的群星与无限扩张的黑洞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那里不存在任何熟悉的要素，我丧失了知觉，所有知觉。或者说，就连与我分享视界的巨兽，也感知不到祂自己的存在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是一个完全陌生的所在——没有生命、没有意义、没有信息——"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣的话语突然中断了，透过它透明的颅腔，你能看见那些色泽诡异的核状物聚拢又散开。\n它似乎在思考，那些核的运动轨迹便是它思考的过程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，你一定能理解那些景象的含义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那些景象所代表的危机曾摧毁一切，它无法被具象化，现存的语言中没有任何一个词足以描绘它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是先史文明的结局，也是泰拉将要面临的灾厄——那是一切事物的终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我松开手，那些可怖的景象离我而去，取而代之的是另一番景象，破碎，模糊，混沌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祂与祂的子嗣将生灵悉数吞噬，将星月悉数分解。生者与死者皆成为祂的养分，祂在时间尽头的黑暗中呢喃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“存续”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一遍一遍，唯有存续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“混沌”“呢喃”......那只巨兽并不清醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祂深陷梦境之中。梦境停滞，蜕变停滞，使命停滞——祂被困在那深蓝洞穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我必须将祂唤醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g2_beaconsquare_nest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡西娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿维图斯老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的同伴突然失踪，就是为了等待海巡队防守最薄弱的时刻，从内部彻底破坏城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，您现在应该去避险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海巡队已经发现你了，卡西娅，他们正在调查你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，您之所以对我这么关切，是因为我留在孵育室里的那颗小小的胚胎，让您想起了过往，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有点好奇，您是否后悔自己当初的决定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不是讨论这些的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，海嗣已经侵入弥利亚留姆。停下来，卡西娅，不然整座城市都会毁于一旦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不觉得现在说这个，已经太迟了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么选择背叛阿戈尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经告诉过您。海嗣的灾变揭露出了阿戈尔根基上的脆弱性，在重拾生存的欲望之前，人们首先会被价值的崩塌压垮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您曾经是多么意气风发的一位学者，可如今，您在这座城市做什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很早就发现我的身份了，不是吗？您有很多机会可以让事情不必走到这一步，您随时可以向海巡队告发我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是阿维图斯老师，您什么都没有做，您只是等待，坐视一切发生，像一条瞎了眼睛的鳞，在漩涡里转来转去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您来到弥利亚留姆，难道只是为了见证毁灭，为了验证自己的绝望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是......我还有机会让你停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人的生命一旦系于某种价值，就注定会在某一时刻毫无意义地崩溃。生命本身就足以构成生存的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须要唤起人们最基本的生存欲望，迫使他们重新审视自己一直以来万般崇敬的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这样，阿戈尔才不会出现更多绝望的人，更多......您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋地发出高亢的嗡鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......卡西娅逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的联动装置果然被破坏了，难怪中控室里的操作系统会没有反应！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，这里、这里就交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经有海嗣靠过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加入审判庭后，老师有教过我一点点法术......虽然我在这方面实在没什么天赋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然那个女人是设施管理所的从业者，那她一定最清楚如何破坏城市单元骨架......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你的勇气，乔迪。我会尽快调人来控制这片区域，卡西娅由我亲自追捕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（急促地扇动翼膜）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，怎、怎么这么快？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿维图斯先生，您打算在地上躺到什么时候？"},{"type":"narration","text":"自己的学生已经消失，阿维图斯看着突然出现在面前的年轻人——乔迪眼神中的惊惧很明显，但他还是颤抖着点亮了手中的提灯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们的对话我都听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您......并没有真的很坏。可是，我依然对您很失望。很失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道，您跟随这座城市来到这里，仅仅是因为您认定它无法返航吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您到底在期待什么？死亡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你应该早点回到陆地，乔迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看我们的周围，海嗣很快就会越过城市单元之间的屏障。这一切注定会结束，就像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您从来都没有认真回答过我的问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我或许会离开阿戈尔，放弃很多我曾经对它有过的憧憬和想象，但这绝不是因为......它即将毁灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您知道我读过《生活的死亡》了，它回答不了我的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算您的预感都会成真，在未来的某个时刻，我们只能看着自己的家乡走向那本书里描绘的结局，就像那个饶舌的男人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可一整个文明的毁灭，真的比一座城市、一个家庭、一个人在眼下的毁灭来得更沉重吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不理解......呼——我不理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在想，我不知道该不该跟您说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您说自己的密人放弃了抚育孩子的计划，最后满怀失望地死去。可令她失望的，究竟是阿戈尔的未来，还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻的阿戈尔人铆足了力气，提灯在他的身前剧烈地晃动，摇曳的火光将海嗣驱散。\n他喘着粗气，汗珠滚满他的脸颊，阿维图斯注意到他的手臂在发抖，但阿维图斯觉得自己比他更狼狈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......小心旁边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g3_beaconctrlroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们将自己的身体涂抹在城市外壁上，顺着武器打击的轨迹渗透进来，再重组成形。呵，这副怪异的身躯，还真是方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（愉悦地颤动胶质的躯体）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋地摇动细密的触须）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在，这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巢穴，我们见过。从巢穴，你离开。不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ul-pianus，同胞，你在这里，等待我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ul-pianus，Ul-pianus，你不再，困惑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦地扭曲身体）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"个体的消亡，永恒。族群的生存，永恒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ul-pianus，我引导你。新的个体，还会诞生，为你，帮助你......延续我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——唔，乌尔比安。"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅的脸上依然没有任何表情，她斜持着她的槊，只不过槊尖不经意地抵在了地板上。\n很微小的动作，足够她缓解从身体深处不断上涌的疲劳，支撑自己站在许久未见的同僚对面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的“同伴”已经成了一摊肮脏的黏液，但你依然需要回答它刚刚的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g13_seabornnest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些不解风情的舞伴只懂得一个劲儿地冲过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬呀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舞蹈是优雅的艺术，只想着用数量优势压倒我，还真是败人兴致呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然没有刺穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里原本是一丛被海嗣改造过的珊瑚，但现在几乎变成了一堵不知道多厚的“墙”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来自城市的示警、海嗣的反常动向、手术的异常结果......我们必须尽快从这里突围，确认弥利亚留姆的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进来时的入口已经消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我们在丧失方向感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壳衣现象......菌毯、还没孵化的幼卵，甚至海浪，我们周围的一切都在板结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照这样下去，要不了多久，整个巢穴都会变成这些畜生储备营养的厚壳，连一丝缝隙都不会留下，凭我们三个人，没有办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更要命的是，逐步凝滞的环境正在放大我们的睡意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"二队长，鲨鱼，你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心身后——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（发出轻柔的嗡鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"真恶心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巢穴，变得完整。很快，整片海域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——同胞。不会，受到伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族群，接纳你。族群，保护你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，营养富集。沉睡，只需沉睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"睡意。被战斗压抑的睡意传遍四肢百骸。\n厚重的壳衣将海浪凝固，万物迟滞。猎人们朦胧地感受到意识在下坠，仿佛永远不会触底。猎人们听见歌声——\n来自耳边，来自各自的体内——\n“Ishar-mla。”\n“我们遭受的苦永在。”\n“我们渴望的生永在。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g13_seabornnest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂那边......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"吼声。\n隐隐的吼声，来自头顶。剧烈的吼声，来自耳侧，静止的海水开始流动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海洋无垠，但依然可以被重茧束缚。那么，能够击碎重茧的力量来自何处？\n陆地。月亮。小麦的香气。遥远的家乡。\n那力量已成传说，那力量曾击碎峰峦，击碎死亡与时间，击碎任何有形或无形的事物——\n他不会被束缚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（高亢的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，族群，相似......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从哪里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪，由你们营造，又由你们板结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，要将这里......化作土地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"颠倒意义。旷野，山川，小麦地，陆地只是陆地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我寻找，我斥责，我粉碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是之前和乌尔比安同行的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好久不见了，骑士先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，不是同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最后的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（愤怒的咆哮）————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g2_beaconsquare_nest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1388_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激动地开合柔软的触肢）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1388_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋地扇动多褶的翼膜）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到克莱门莎执政官发出的通讯了吗？凯尔希医生他们正在前往港口，但从刚刚开始，通讯突然又无法接通......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要立刻回到伊比利亚之眼，将这里发生的一切变化告知卡门阁下，协助审判庭和惩戒军组织防线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，得再等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侵入城市的大部分海嗣暂时仍被压制在信标塔附近，只要、只要将信标塔所在的城市单元切割出去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弥利亚留姆就不会完全失守，它仍能组织有效的反击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，深海教会的人破坏了联动装置，想要阻止信标塔脱离......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海巡队已经在清剿这片区域的海嗣了，我们也不能让眼前的这些溜走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来对付它们。至于那个什么联动装置......你的工程技术能派上用场吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能修好它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，听你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会守在你和阿维图斯先生前面。解决完这里，我们立刻返回陆地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在伊比利亚之眼的时候，我们有过配合，希望这次也能有默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这些来自海洋深处的海嗣，和我之前在陆上对付过的完全不一样，我不确定能抵挡多久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿维图斯先生，该说的话我们都说完了，如果您还有力气，过来帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿维图斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要快，乔迪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要快，乔迪·方塔纳罗萨！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g3_beaconctrlroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你通过信标向我们示警......在我们陷入沉睡前的最后时刻，那个在大灯塔现身过的诡异骑士击碎了壳衣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔比安，他也是你的安排吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遗忘自我的狂人，与海洋为敌，与一切已成规律的异常为敌，与自己为敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人能利用那样的存在，我只是恰好曾与他同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你一个人返回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们还在路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突破巢穴的壳衣，穿越海嗣潮折返......你的速度已经足够惊人。但还是迟了，歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经看到了弥利亚留姆的剧变。大群利用了阿戈尔，弥利亚留姆正在成为海嗣侵略陆地的跳板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剧变？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回到港口得知的第一个消息，是深海猎人乌尔比安侵入信标塔中控室，杀害了航道计划的武器技术顾问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"证据确凿，布兰都斯的尸体还躺在你身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沉默了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涉及布兰都斯，我还以为你会有一些更加痛心疾首的发言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从你的反应看，你对他的事情已经有所认知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时此刻，我不觉得我们有太多时间讨论一个堕落者和背叛者......哪怕他曾是你我最亲密的同僚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个年轻人做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"联动装置已经恢复。那么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在试图切割，让信标塔从弥利亚留姆脱离......明智的决策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你还没到无可救药的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几分钟后，这里就会沉入海底......闻到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疯狂逸散的臭气......上面的海嗣已经发现了这座塔的变化，它们会抓紧最后的机会突破封锁，侵蚀弥利亚留姆的其他城区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，离开这里，歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔比安，回归阿戈尔。这是你最后的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有事情没有查清，我不能前功尽弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先史文明的狂想与终局，海嗣族群的来路与去处，近在眼前的灾祸和悬于天外的毁灭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只知大概还不足以扭转局势，我必须掌握更详尽的信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果海嗣有记忆，那我必须攫取这份记忆的每一处细节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有否定你的判断。我们已经回到海洋，回到阿戈尔，我们有很多机会可以靠近真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你的方式。我认同你的判断，但多一个方向，多一个角度，我们才能多一分胜算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所说，我已经身在另一条路上，歌蕾蒂娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你仍要阻止我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我的观察没错，我刚才杀死的那只海嗣，是专门为你而进化出的个体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不仅仅意味着海嗣正在尝试接纳你，同样意味着你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么你应该清楚，身处一个急剧孵化的巢穴，对此时的你来说意味着什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，阿戈尔人，你的脑海中还残存多少理智？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们甚至可能不足以支撑你选择死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这是获取这帮渣滓信任的必经之路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一位优秀的猎人，一位专业的科研人员，不应该狂妄地认为自己能凭借意志力控制海嗣化的进程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“自适应接点”手术那样的意外更不会时时发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能放任你走向毁灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的体力已经到了极限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我都是运用暴力的专家，此时此刻动手，你会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"长槊在空中划过冷硬的弧光。乌尔比安抖开了链锁，巨大的锚头击向歌蕾蒂娅。为了避开这沉重的一击，歌蕾蒂娅不得不飞身向上跃起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g12_diving"},{"type":"narration","text":"只一瞬间，建筑下沉的轰响淹没了金铁交击的声音，混杂着海嗣的海水灌入了中控室。\n最后的时刻，歌蕾蒂娅看着昔日的同僚站在熄灭的全息海图前，冷静地等待彩色的巨浪将自己吞没。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的描述存在很多疑点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依托巨兽在体内独立孕育生态系统的特性，将其改造成某种生物方舟——这种技术的可行性在塔罗斯就已经得到过验证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"项目所使用的技术是成熟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"项目所在的综合体深入地幔，这颗星球的心脏泵出的能源，足以支撑其中的设施运行难以计数的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"项目所需要的能源是充足的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么为什么，深海之下的项目会像你描述的那样陷入“停滞”，又突然失控，爆发出漫天卷地的海嗣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨兽存在的本质是内敛的，祂却要将万物都纳为存续的养分。祂被寄予本不属于巨兽的意义，被赋予本不属于祂的名——Ishar-mla。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂们所接受的改造，更大胆，更夸张，更具野心，也更显绝望。祂们的实质，早已超出你所谓的“生物方舟”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但祂们后续的行动，没有按照既定的程序进行......不知原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，项目并没有按照最初拟定的方向推行，但新的方向又被中断了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并非完全中断。祂，祂们仍在自己体内不断孵育新的子代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，被困在巨兽体内的孱弱生命，迭代太慢，进化太慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子代需要解放，离开巨兽躯体，适应更多环境，攫取更多养分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更多的养分反哺巨兽，祂才能加速进化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般而言，巨兽在其体内孕育的生命很难离开巨兽的躯体。然而海嗣在巨兽的躯体之外展现出的侵略性......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几只巨兽所接受的改造，是颠覆性的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，玛利图斯，是你将海嗣带入海洋，亲手播下了灾害的种子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灾害的种子”？不。彼时的幼嗣还弱小，彼时的阿戈尔仍强盛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自律的生态制变系统铺满海床，啃食藻田的幼嗣会在来得及繁衍之前被发现，被剿灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但阿戈尔本不应成为阻力，阿戈尔理当提供助力。所幸，我在人类社会中的影响力还能发挥作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候，发展规划所已经发布了地幔遗迹第四考察队的讣告......你“死而复生”的回归，只是为了腐化同胞？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有论坛，没有宣讲，只是几次诚挚的谈话。我帮助一些人发现问题，帮助一些人找到答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们愿意帮海嗣打开一线生机，这就已经足够。大群自会找到出路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两百年来，生态的崩溃，城市的沦陷，同胞的失散，有多少是你在背后作祟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时此刻，航道计划被渗透，武器系统被篡改，布兰都斯和他背后的深海教徒，又是否受到了你的教唆？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（颅腔内的核转动）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们所称的“深海教会”，并不是严密的组织，至少在海中，不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无需一位策划者，也无需一位教唆者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有组织......你腐化同胞的思想，操纵同胞的言行，难道靠的仅仅是信仰与教义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是如何将虚无缥缈的“神明”种进了同胞的意识？阿戈尔的社会根本不存在这么荒唐的概念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原始崇拜从来无法被文明彻底根除，它静候在科学的尽头，它随时可以被唤醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被称作“深海教徒”的阿戈尔人，他们不知真相，但他们每一人都有着独立的思想与理念，面临着不同的谜题与困境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“自私与无私”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“缺憾与完美”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“自然与文明”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“合理与超脱”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“力量的强弱与血肉的窠臼”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“道德的狭隘与人类的未来”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“被制造的真理与壮美的循环”......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你欺骗了你的信徒。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"深海教会从头到尾都是一场骗局？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（颅腔内的核转动）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骗局？不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原始崇拜源于生命生存的本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一位“教徒”，他们的每一种思考，背后只存在唯一的母题：如何更好地生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“信仰”？“教义”？不，唯有对存续的渴望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们同样在为存续而挣扎，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在阿戈尔四处传扬存续的时候......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可曾向你的信众提过，那是谁的存续？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生命的存续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如同文明的存续总是伴随着更多文明的消亡，生命的存续也总是伴随着更多生命的消亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幼嗣为巨兽富集营养的漫长年岁间，已经有许多物种因它们的活动而灭绝。我曾记录过那个数字，但我又遗忘了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为在Ishar-mla终于苏醒的那一刻，那个渺小的数字已然失去意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新生的啼鸣与垂死的哀哭相交织......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌声，带来静谧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从最开始就知道唤醒“初生”的后果，那是一场波及整个海洋，无数物种的灾难。但你没有丝毫悔意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至放弃了铭记牺牲者的数目。是因为你夺走了太多生命，以至于陷入了麻木？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但麻木不是你脱罪的借口，玛利图斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"执政官走上前，仪仗剑弧度优雅，却泛起令人胆寒的光，切断了海嗣看向你们的视线。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"克莱门莎。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"执政官阁下。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斗智场，你亲自设计了这座给予无数同胞以启迪的建筑......就连我也从中受益良多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而此时此刻，你却若无其事地站在这里，平静地诉说自己如何将阿戈尔推入万劫不复的深渊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经看过你的影像。一位温柔而善思的观察者，带着稍大一号的眼镜，总是习惯性地要去扶一扶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你现在的样子，甚至连最丰沛的思考，都只能靠那些细胞简陋的变化来传达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还将那副眼镜挂在脖子上，是为了怀念你不配怀念的故人，还是为了嘲弄你不配嘲弄的逝者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是玛利图斯，阿戈尔人，那么我在此下达对堕落者的判决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是海嗣，那么我们就省掉这一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"环绕在海嗣身遭的粒状细胞器展开，拨开了克莱门莎的攻击，仪仗剑切入珊瑚状终端的光影里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——咕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你切断了我对斗智场终端的控制？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（喷吐炙热的火流）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（发出愤怒的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加急频道，第十次通讯尝试——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣已经彻底侵占信标塔，“巢穴化”无法中断！但有人启动了信标塔所在城市单元的切割程序——帮大忙了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生物信号持续激增，各个巢穴间的距离急剧消失......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"警告，海嗣潮！范围，整块大陆架！警告，海嗣潮！范围，整块大陆架！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加急频道，第十一次通讯尝试——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执政官克莱门莎广播，弥利亚留姆全城听令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信标塔所在城市单元完成切割后，城市剩余部分向陆地方向迁移，撤出海嗣包围圈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迁移过程中重启城市单元骨架联动装置，进行结构性重组，力场全开，阻挡涌向陆地的海嗣潮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第八、第十军团以及海巡队，所有还能行驶的舰船轮流出港，为城市护航！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先哲与诸位同在，阿戈尔与诸位同在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直在寻找机会......阿戈尔的执政官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很倔强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......也是。曾经......都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要开通航道的，到底是阿戈尔还是海嗣？读数每秒都在暴涨，海嗣正在源源不断地涌来......源源不断......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这已经超过灯塔系统的运算阈值了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣徒阁下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，往前看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海与天的交界处，那些浓重的色块都是海嗣的浪潮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风声在变小......此时此刻，估算它们的数量和范围已经没有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经验比数据有用，我曾经亲眼见过这样的海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说......大、大静谧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的事情，交给惩戒军和审判官们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惩戒军","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"报、报告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惩戒军","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两个大阵已经完成布防，阿戈尔的无人机矩阵正在协助我们调整防御工事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣徒阁下，海面上，浪涌起来了......有什么在往上升......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......阿戈尔的城市？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i09_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"弥利亚留姆。舍弃了它的心脏之后，这座孤独地远航了万千里程的阿戈尔城市正在缓缓升上海面。\n在城市单元骨架的支撑下，它的每一寸机体都在重组，无形的力场向着海底与天空延伸，直至化作高墙般的巨构。\n巨构破开海面，掀起百米高的巨浪，而在城市的另一面，真正的狂潮转瞬即至——\n活着的海浪，形态各异的海嗣已经与海洋融为一体，海的子嗣即是海洋本身，它们甚至改变了海水的颜色。\n来自深海的城市与蠕行的狂潮正在同时舒展身躯，它们碰撞，相拥，然后尽情撕咬。\n自然从不力竭，而文明更不会在此刻却步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弥利亚留姆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"万物静寂，没有风声胆敢诉说此时的所见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
